From 5c67f4f645ea39cfb7b8ac0eee97187cf618517e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: letress <212964567+letress@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 22:04:33 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 110/113] ASoC: samsung: Add the Exynos9610 ABOX audio unit and
 the Motorola One Action card

ABOX runs the Calliope firmware (SRAM mailbox, IPC, read DMA 1 to UAIF0); the
card routes it through the CS47L35 codec to the CS35L41 speaker amplifier.
Values come from the vendor machine driver and from register dumps of the stock
system.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
